  "allocator_shim_patch": "rustc_codegen_nvvm/src/allocator.rs: define empty callable NO_ALLOC_SHIM_IS_UNSTABLE marker, matching pinned rustc ABI instead of leaving unresolved extern.",
  "modern_optimization_patch": "rustc_codegen_nvvm/rustc_llvm_wrapper/PassWrapper.cpp: replace empty LLVM19+ legacy optimization compatibility stub with a modern PassBuilder default per-module pipeline at the requested optimization/size level, preserving vectorization/inliner settings; no game rules or fast-math changes.",
  "optimized_intrinsic_patch": "LLVM optimizer-created scalar/vector fabs lowered after module merge to an exact integer sign-bit clear, preserving -0/NaN payload behavior, because NVVM13.3 rejects llvm.fabs.f64; verifier remains mandatory."
